Browser -> DNS
Browser -> Load balancer
Load balancer -> Ingress controller
Ingress controller -> Web service, API service
Web service -> Web pod 1, Web pod 2
API service -> API pod 1, API pod 2, API pod 3
Web pod 1, Web pod 2 -> API service
API pod 1, API pod 2, API pod 3 -> Database proxy
API pod 1, API pod 2, API pod 3 -> Cache
Database proxy -> Primary database
Primary database -> Read replica
Metrics agent -> Metrics store
API pod 1, Web pod 1 -> Metrics agent
Cluster {
  Ingress controller
  Web namespace {
    Web service, Web pod 1, Web pod 2
  }
  API namespace {
    API service, API pod 1, API pod 2, API pod 3, Cache
  }
  Metrics agent
}
Data {
  Database proxy, Primary database, Read replica
}
